---
description: Enforce logging of self-evolving intelligence in idea-log.json
globs: ["**"]
alwaysApply: true
ruleType: Always
---

* All agents that identify optimization patterns, repeatable abstractions, or user experience risks must log them in `/cursor/self-expansion/idea-log.json`.  
* Each idea entry must include a title, description, agent name, confidenceScore (0–1), impact estimate, and timestamp.  
* Do not discard surfaced improvements silently — log them even if confidence is low.  
* When an idea becomes implemented or rejected, update the `status` field accordingly.  
* This file acts as a trust-layer mirror of Codex’s forward-thinking — preserve its integrity and cadence.  

